* OTA AM — OUT ∝ ENV · CARRIER
*
* Pins: CARRIER ENV OUT VCC VEE
*   CARRIER — bipolar tone (raw; attenuated inside to ±~200 mV)
*   ENV     — non-negative control (Iabc ∝ ENV)
*   OUT     — product, AC-ish around 0
*
* Uses one HALF13700. Small-signal: Iout ≈ Iabc · Vd/(2·Vt), Vd from CARRIER.

.subckt am CARRIER ENV OUT VCC VEE

* Iabc: ENV → current into IAB (HALF13700 senses to VSS). Floor keeps OTA alive.
* ~20 µA at ENV=1 V
Biabc 0 IAB I = 2u + V(ENV) / 50e3

* Carrier → ±224 mV class differential (enc_a attenuator family)
Rd1 CARRIER INP 47k
Rd2 INP 0 2.2k
Rd3 0 INN 2.2k
Rlin LIN VEE 100Meg
Rbin BIN VEE 100Meg
Rbuf BUF VEE 100Meg

Xota LIN INP INN IAB IOUT VCC VEE BIN BUF HALF13700

* Current → voltage; AC couple so a DC Iabc pedestal does not sit on OUT
Rout IOUT 0 10k
Cac IOUT OUT 1u
Rbleed OUT 0 100k

.ends am
